elnino_data <- read_table(
  here::here("datasets", "ELNINO.DAT"),
  skip = 25,
  col_names = c("SouthernOscillation", "YearMonth", "Year", "Month")
) |>
  drop_na()

ggplot(elnino_data, aes(YearMonth, SouthernOscillation)) +
  geom_line() +
  labs(title = "Southern Oscillations", x = NULL, y = NULL) +
  theme_light()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Run sequence plot of southern oscillations data shows no obvious seasonality](index_files/figure-html/fig-pmc-443-osc-run-sequence-1.png){#fig-pmc-443-osc-run-sequence width=672}
